sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant 2FA as TwoFactorService
    participant Repo
    
    User->>Gateway: Setup 2FA
    Gateway->>2FA: setup(userId)
    2FA->>2FA: generateSecret()
    2FA->>Repo: store(userId, secret, status=PENDING)
    2FA-->>Gateway: secret/URI
    Gateway-->>User: QR Code
